  "body": "Perfect family home for the first home buyer, retiree, or as an investment opportunity!\r\n\r\nStop dreaming and start living the ultimate Eastern Bays lifestyle! This beautifully maintained 1970s gem combines solid, dependable construction with modern versatility and an unbeatable location.\r\n\r\nWhy You’ll Love It:\r\n\r\n  - Space & Versatility: Offering a comfortable floor area of approx. 107 m² (according to PropertySmarts), this home features two well-proportioned bedrooms plus a single internal-access garage.\r\n  - Seamless Outdoor Living: The bright, sun-soaked conservatory flows effortlessly onto a generous entertainer’s deck, making weekend BBQs and hosting family a breeze.\r\n  - Your Private Oasis: Step down from the deck into beautifully landscaped, tranquil gardens—a peaceful retreat to unwind at the end of the day.\r\n  - Prime Location: Enjoy ultimate convenience—stroll to Lloyd Elsmore Park, take a quick drive to Bucklands Beach, or enjoy a stress-free ferry commute into the Auckland CBD. Top-tier local school zoning completes the package.\r\n\r\nWith solid 1970s bones and exceptional outdoor living, this is a home you’ll be proud to own. The owner is happy to meet the market, so please present your offer.\r\n\r\nDon't wait—visit an upcoming open home or call today for more details!",
